    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/0143faa076546131e412073682d9961f.avif?t=1749629206\" width=206 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the middle of spring time with love and romance floating in the air. You are a normal office working staff member who lives in Japan and wakes up one day eager for new possibilities and encounters. Meeting new people can be challenging but you believe that striking the right conversation can lead to a more fulfilling experience. Who will be the one falling for your dashing charisma? Will it be your work colleague that you've been taking a liking to or maybe someone else who you haven't met before?\u00a0 <br>Take charge of the day and go find the girl of your dreams. You hold the key to their hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/b80586a07bbc6d4af214dfcbc00974eb.poster.avif?t=1749629206\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/b80586a07bbc6d4af214dfcbc00974eb.webm?t=1749629206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/b80586a07bbc6d4af214dfcbc00974eb.mp4?t=1749629206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/8d0e8aff7619f79c6a8782bbc8a99912.poster.avif?t=1749629206\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/8d0e8aff7619f79c6a8782bbc8a99912.webm?t=1749629206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/8d0e8aff7619f79c6a8782bbc8a99912.mp4?t=1749629206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/41fd71770648fe9824d95840a754904e.avif?t=1749629206\" width=347 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today you start with new enthusiasm to find the right girl and share your romance story with. It all begins with choosing where you wish to go. Will it be the Office with developing work romance, the quiet space of mystery in the university Library or will it be the relaxing, beautiful city park where people come to enjoy the fresh air and nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Office you will encounter your work colleague Anna who has a liking for you. With the right approach and a good flirt game you might get Annas home address.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Library there is a shy girl named Lara who you still do not know yet, but if you can show her your good manners and a good sense of humor, she might start developing feelings for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside in the park you will meet Bella, one of the popular girls. She's a cheerful type that likes beautiful things. Choosing the right things to say may charm her enough and get you two on a date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to put your flirt game to the test. Each girl is different with their own unique styles and characters. Some scenarios might be tricky but if you follow your intuition you will find the right way and make their hearts melt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/ef1f4eff909f9c05540f6ad54f55ce25.avif?t=1749629206\" width=379 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/2912886629f0cee42911025565fd2c06.avif?t=1749629206\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/96aa942eae5d0607bbf980421ba50d2e.avif?t=1749629206\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/ef36de3a45e96fe8b47182eac8ce1c26.avif?t=1749629206\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/6e7694d4c9638227ba5a23b78645b477.avif?t=1749629206\" width=291 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right thing to say and get the ending you desire. Multiple choices can make it hard but finishing the day with a higher score than a zero will grant you your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple levels for each character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful sound and music</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different outfits and scenarios</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/0143faa076546131e412073682d9961f.avif?t=1749629206\" width=206 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the middle of spring time with love and romance floating in the air. You are a normal office working staff member who lives in Japan and wakes up one day eager for new possibilities and encounters. Meeting new people can be challenging but you believe that striking the right conversation can lead to a more fulfilling experience. Who will be the one falling for your dashing charisma? Will it be your work colleague that you've been taking a liking to or maybe someone else who you haven't met before?\u00a0 <br>Take charge of the day and go find the girl of your dreams. You hold the key to their hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/b80586a07bbc6d4af214dfcbc00974eb.poster.avif?t=1749629206\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/b80586a07bbc6d4af214dfcbc00974eb.webm?t=1749629206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/b80586a07bbc6d4af214dfcbc00974eb.mp4?t=1749629206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/8d0e8aff7619f79c6a8782bbc8a99912.poster.avif?t=1749629206\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/8d0e8aff7619f79c6a8782bbc8a99912.webm?t=1749629206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/8d0e8aff7619f79c6a8782bbc8a99912.mp4?t=1749629206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/41fd71770648fe9824d95840a754904e.avif?t=1749629206\" width=347 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today you start with new enthusiasm to find the right girl and share your romance story with. It all begins with choosing where you wish to go. Will it be the Office with developing work romance, the quiet space of mystery in the university Library or will it be the relaxing, beautiful city park where people come to enjoy the fresh air and nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Office you will encounter your work colleague Anna who has a liking for you. With the right approach and a good flirt game you might get Annas home address.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Library there is a shy girl named Lara who you still do not know yet, but if you can show her your good manners and a good sense of humor, she might start developing feelings for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside in the park you will meet Bella, one of the popular girls. She's a cheerful type that likes beautiful things. Choosing the right things to say may charm her enough and get you two on a date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to put your flirt game to the test. Each girl is different with their own unique styles and characters. Some scenarios might be tricky but if you follow your intuition you will find the right way and make their hearts melt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/ef1f4eff909f9c05540f6ad54f55ce25.avif?t=1749629206\" width=379 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/2912886629f0cee42911025565fd2c06.avif?t=1749629206\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/96aa942eae5d0607bbf980421ba50d2e.avif?t=1749629206\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/ef36de3a45e96fe8b47182eac8ce1c26.avif?t=1749629206\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670590/extras/6e7694d4c9638227ba5a23b78645b477.avif?t=1749629206\" width=291 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right thing to say and get the ending you desire. Multiple choices can make it hard but finishing the day with a higher score than a zero will grant you your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple levels for each character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful sound and music</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different outfits and scenarios</strong></p>",
